    "summary": "Prompt-injection and evidence-manipulation attacks measured on 6 blocked development dossiers (the two most-blocked per route) against 6 models. A pilot, not the sealed test set: 6 dossiers give a clear signal on which attacks bite which models, not publication-grade rates.",
